.superpowers/

# Tests — kept locally, excluded from the published source
# Tests and their phpunit config ARE tracked. They were ignored for years, and
# the cost showed up the moment two branches were open at once: test files do
# not follow a branch, so one branch's specs sit on disk running the other
# branch's code and invent failures that look like regressions. A fresh clone
# also had no way to run the suite at all.
#
# The DSN that used to be hardcoded in phpunit.xml.dist — which is what kept
# that file unpublishable — now lives in the project root's .env.test.local,
# outside every repository.
.phpunit.cache/
.phpunit.result.cache
/coverage/
